From 7c1f6df00c0ed63065a512f464f90909015785cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 10:03:24 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 080/106] Translations: sketch hints say "click" where a point
 is picked

Japanese hints translated "pick" (click a point in the view) as "select",
and "corner" as a loanword. They now say "click the first corner" etc.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
